  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p>• About our brand and products:</p><p>UPPERVOID is a movement-focused outdoor brand exploring the intersection of technical apparel, nature, and contemporary urban mobility. Our collections combine advanced performance fabrics, functional design systems, and avant-garde outdoor aesthetics for trail running, hiking, travel, and all-terrain daily wear.</p><p><br></p><p>• What makes us different:</p><p>We focus on sensory-driven outdoorwear — balancing protection, breathability, movement efficiency, and visual identity. UPPERVOID integrates technical materials such as DERMIZAX®, POLARTEC®, TORAY®, and OUTLAST® with aerodynamic cuts, ergonomic sweat-management systems, and modular functional detailing.</p><p><br></p><p>• How affiliates can earn:</p><p>Affiliates earn 10.00% commission per completed order through tracked referral links and marketplace attribution.</p><p><br></p><p>• How to promote us:</p><p>UPPERVOID performs especially well through:</p><p>- Techwear / gorpcore styling content</p><p>- Trail running &amp; outdoor performance videos</p><p>- Editorial photography</p><p>- Functional outfit breakdowns</p><p>- YouTube reviews</p><p>- Instagram reels / TikTok motion-focused content</p><p>- Outdoor lifestyle storytelling</p><p><br></p><p>• Other information:</p><p>We regularly release seasonal collections, limited colorways, and technical outerwear capsules. High-quality visual assets and product support are available for selected partners and creators.</p></div></div>",
